OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FChance of a light shower at
OL,6,Ffirst. Otherwise it will be a dry day
OL,7,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,8,Fsome bright or sunny intervals. Brisk
OL,9,Fnorthwesterly winds at first along the
OL,10,Feast coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThis evening will be mainly
OL,13,Fdry. The rest of the night will be
OL,14,Flargely dry with clear periods and the
OL,15,Fodd shower across Dumfries and
OL,16,FGalloway.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
