OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA mostly dry day although
OL,6,Ffairly cloudy at times, some bright
OL,7,Fspells possible across the east. Brisk
OL,8,Fsouthwesterly winds across Edinburgh
OL,9,Fand Lothian.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fwith a chance of rain across the west
OL,13,Fand north on Saturday, east coast
OL,14,Fdrier. Patchy rain at first on Sunday
OL,15,Fotherwise dry. Dry on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
